ntries (never fatal), and a revision failure leaves the verdict/rounds intact (`changes-rejected.json` + exit 0, `--strict-exit` → 4). A code source additionally gets a `revised-draft.patch`; a prose source instead gets a redline section in the full-handoff HTML — see Artifact Standard above (v1.13 P3). Synthesis stays your reasoning task — the conductor stops at clean per-round packets and hands them to you (or one neutral seat) to fill `verdict.json`, then you call the chain.
 
